{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","commonName":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","title":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","order":53,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"151e26128ad00dd179d82309d785fe86e720d3a75301de7825a6b5ba5da4f48d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["問候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["保羅、西拉、提摩太寫信給帖撒羅尼迦、在上帝－我們的父與主耶穌基督裏的教會。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["願恩惠、平安從父上帝和主耶穌基督歸與你們！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["基督再來時的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["弟兄們，我們該為你們常常感謝上帝，這本是合宜的；因你們的信心格外增長，並且你們眾人彼此相愛的心也都充足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["甚至我們在上帝的各教會裏為你們誇口，都因你們在所受的一切逼迫患難中，仍舊存忍耐和信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["這正是上帝公義判斷的明證，叫你們可算配得上帝的國；你們就是為這國受苦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["上帝既是公義的，就必將患難報應那加患難給你們的人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["也必使你們這受患難的人與我們同得平安。那時，主耶穌同他有能力的天使從天上在火焰中顯現，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["要報應那不認識上帝和那不聽從我主耶穌福音的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他們要受刑罰，就是永遠沉淪，離開主的面和他權能的榮光。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["這正是主降臨、要在他聖徒的身上得榮耀、又在一切信的人身上顯為希奇的那日子。我們對你們作的見證，你們也信了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因此，我們常為你們禱告，願我們的上帝看你們配得過所蒙的召，又用大能成就你們一切所羨慕的良善和一切因信心所做的工夫，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["叫我們主耶穌的名在你們身上得榮耀，你們也在他身上得榮耀，都照着我們的上帝並主耶穌基督的恩。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}